{"id":"OdsaYel_UY0","title":"We Are South America","channel":"South Park Studios","duration":210,"uploaded":"2026-09-20","lines":[[14.44,16.76,"What's going on?"],[16.76,18.68,"Stan lost a really good friend today,"],[18.68,21.84,"Randy. You want to tell your dad, honey?"],[21.84,23.32,"Me and my friends"],[23.32,26.04,"we just wanted to be like everyone else."],[26.04,27,"So"],[27,29.4,"we went and got e-bikes."],[29.4,33.64,"Then Kenny exploded and he died."],[33.64,36,"Wait, that was Kenny?"],[36,38.44,"You heard about it? It was awful. He was"],[38.44,40.36,"so happy, too."],[40.36,41.52,"He thought he'd really had found his"],[41.52,44.4,"voice for once."],[44.44,46.44,"Did they find the bomb?"],[46.44,48,"Well, no, it wasn't a bomb. Probably the"],[48,49.48,"battery just blew up cuz we signed for"],[49.48,50.96,"our liability."],[50.96,52.72,"Well, yeah, they're just dangerous."],[52.72,54.2,"That's what I've been trying to tell"],[54.2,55.72,"everybody."],[55.72,58.92,"And I didn't listen. I'm sorry, Dad."],[58.92,61.44,"This is all my fault."],[61.44,63.08,"Hey, listen."],[63.08,65.2,"This is not your fault, Stan."],[65.2,67.96,"It's everyone's fault who got an e-bike."],[67.96,69.8,"It's too bad it took someone having to"],[69.8,72.36,"die to open people's eyes."],[72.36,73.32,"Yeah."],[73.32,75.12,"But I know one thing"],[75.12,77.24,"that this community is going to come"],[77.24,78.96,"together over this."],[78.96,83.28,"Because that's what South America does."],[83.28,86.28,"We are all united in grief."],[86.28,89.52,"But as South America always does, we"],[89.52,92.68,"will find solace in each other."],[92.68,95.56,"I am so inspired by the way our town has"],[95.56,98.32,"come together. And as mayor, I am"],[98.32,100.72,"honored to officially announce"],[100.72,104.72,"the Kenny McCormick e-bike ordinance."],[104.72,107.56,"We are South"],[107.56,109.68,"America,"],[109.68,111.84,"where the cold"],[111.84,112.76,"north"],[112.76,115.34,"wind blows."],[115.48,118.08,"If you're"],[118.08,120.24,"through our"],[121.52,122.2,"mountain town, I just think you should"],[122.2,125.16,"know."],[125.64,127.96,"Suck my dick. My dick!"],[127.96,130.12,"We are South"],[130.12,132.12,"America."],[132.12,134.44,"In that northern"],[134.44,135.76,"mountain"],[135.76,137.72,"sun,"],[137.72,140.04,"we'll always be"],[140.04,141.4,"South"],[141.4,143.84,"America."],[143.84,147.04,"We won't change for"],[147.12,149.24,"anyone."],[149.52,152.62,"Two words that bring a smile to my"],[152.62,155,"mouth,"],[155.12,157.56,"America"],[157.56,159.88,"and South."],[159.88,161.12,"We are South"],[161.12,163.88,"America."],[166.84,169.56,"We are South"],[169.56,171.72,"America."],[171.72,174.94,"In that northern"],[175.28,177.4,"mountain sun,"],[177.4,179.6,"we'll always be"],[179.6,181.72,"South"],[182.36,183.2,"America."],[183.2,186,"We won't change for"],[186,190.01,"anyone."]]}